        <mxCell id="note123" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px&quot;&gt;TAKE_ORDER branch final outcome: 18/18 turns; 5 paid; $64.50; average paid satisfaction 80.40; zero unhappy departures. CLI prints the final result. Critic #6 cannot pay before the deadline, as intended.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;overflow=fill;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#20252b;fillColor=#f6f9fc;">
