        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note127" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px&quot;&gt;Scope: one complex Stage 2 use case with a separately replayed alternative. ref frames abbreviate existing interactions; they do not add methods to the code. OptionalInt/getSummary return details and pure GameView construction are abbreviated. Parameters r and action factories are shorthand for actual Restaurant / action records.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;overflow=fill;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#20252b;fillColor=#f6f9fc;">
